<h1 id="light-and-fatigue-in-the-short-drama-factory" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#light-and-fatigue-in-the-short-drama-factory" class="header-mark"></a>Light and Fatigue in the Short Drama Factory</h1><p>It was raining in Xi&rsquo;an that day.</p>
<p>Autumn had just arrived. The wind on the Bailu Plain location was cold, and the rain refused to stop.
A crew of nearly forty was stuck inside a faux-antique courtyard. The slate said it plainly: twenty-two scenes had to be finished that day.</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>